  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div data-module-name=\"article-header\" data-module-version=\"1.0.0\" data-module-instance=\"default\"><h2>The average production cost was sitting at $88,000 per bitcoin in mid-March, according to Checkonchain's difficulty regression model.</h2><p><span>Updated<!-- --> <!-- -->Mar 22, 2026, 4:35 p.m. </span><span>Published<!-- --> <!-- -->Mar 22, 2026, 6:26 a.m. </span></p><p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=coindesk.com\">Make <svg width=\"83\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 83 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M23.575 11.1954C22.0743 11.1954 21.1445 9.85899 21.1445 8.00995C21.1445 6.17921 21.927 4.81531 23.5658 4.81531C24.643 4.81531 25.3519 5.50184 25.4808 6.40805H27.985C27.8561 5.28215 27.3497 4.29355 26.4659 3.63449C25.7478 3.08527 24.7535 2.74658 23.575 2.74658C20.5552 2.74658 18.5942 5.01669 18.5942 8.00995C18.5942 11.0215 20.6197 13.2275 23.5934 13.2275C25.0205 13.2275 26.0608 12.8339 26.8342 12.0833C27.5246 11.4243 27.985 10.5089 28.0494 9.51115H25.5452C25.4347 10.4906 24.6982 11.1954 23.575 11.1954Z\" fill=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M32.6693 5.61475C30.3493 5.61475 28.7933 7.26241 28.7933 9.43183C28.7933 11.6013 30.3493 13.2489 32.6693 13.2489C35.0078 13.2489 36.5361 11.6013 36.5361 9.43183C36.5361 7.26241 35.0078 5.61475 32.6693 5.61475ZM32.6601 11.6104C31.6566 11.6104 31.1318 10.7408 31.1318 9.43183C31.1318 8.12285 31.6566 7.23495 32.6601 7.23495C33.6636 7.23495 34.2068 8.12285 34.2068 9.43183C34.1976 10.7408 33.6636 11.6104 32.6601 11.6104Z\" fill=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M39.8159 4.8467C40.3084 4.35697 40.3084 3.56295 39.8159 3.07322C39.3233 2.58349 38.5247 2.58349 38.0321 3.07322C37.5396 3.56295 37.5396 4.35697 38.0321 4.8467C38.5247 5.33644 39.3233 5.33644 39.8159 4.8467Z\" fill=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M36.916 7.42587H37.8827V13.0188H40.1844V5.80566H36.916V7.42587Z\" fill=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M45.8468 5.59375C44.